            "review_title": "Review at Avenue Saigon",
            "review_text": "Maddy F\n1 contribution\n0\nA Taste of America!\nNov 2024 • Family\nCame here for dinner and drinks and was not disappointed. The music and food made me feel like I was back in the U.S. which I loved. It's a cute, intimate spot with darts and a bar. I ordered the wagyu burger with cajun curly fries and a Singapore sling to drink. They were all delicious! Staff was friendly and attentive. I would come back again!\nWritten December 30, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
