            "review_title": "Review at Avenue Saigon",
            "review_text": "Thomas\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nAwesome spot to get a drink, bite and watch sports\nNov 2023 • Friends\nAwesome spot to get a drink, bite and watch sports. Service is super friendly and attentive. Drinks are really good and reasonably priced. The wagyu burger is indeed the standout menu item, and have eaten it plenty of times now! Darts and the foosbal table also a plus so you can beat your mates! Recommended!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 27, 2023",
