            "review_text": "Steven V\nNha Trang, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGreat sports bar with banging burgers\nDec 2023 • Friends\nVisited a sports bar in Saigon last weekend. Good spot for watching games. The burgers were surprisingly tasty - well-cooked and flavorful. Staff was decent, and they had a decent beer selection. It’s a solid choice if you’re in the area and looking for a casual evening.\nWritten December 27, 2023",
